0f2ee6b/","observation_id":"obs_4de0f2ee6b155385d102dae21cda1272f544c5358d20d95a137a695eac7ce348","published_at":"2026-08-24T17:59:04Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"SWE Refactor Bench 是一个评测基准，旨在检验代码生成代理能否自主完成整体仓库的栈迁移。它包含 20 项迁移任务，覆盖四类技术债务，并通过三阶段评估同时衡量迁移的完整性和行为的一致性。","title":"SWE Refactor Bench: Can Coding Agents Complete a Long-Horizon, Whole-Repository Stack Migration?"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_3d5bcfedf2f5a1ee5def60afb078ab638b571b373d8548066eebcd7a001fc9e8","internal_url":"/posts/20260825-arxiv-eg-arsa-an-expert-grounded-open-model-for-visual-r-0-f4c05f6c7a/","observation_id":"obs_f4c05f6c7afe23690233e2a5090bf342edda16445de5664eac1d13b7df5c91f8","published_at":"2026-08-24T17:58:41Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这是一个将专家道路安全评估知识迁移到轻量级视觉语言模型的框架，通过专家校准的教师模型生成监督信号来训练更小的学生模型，用于可扩展的道路安全视觉审计。","title":"EG-ARSA: An Expert-Grounded Open Model for Visual Road Safety Auditing in Low-Resource Settings"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_e001b631c5d7b6bddb6f8b18a7057e369f9981383cd69cb2028ea53ed7a71398","internal_url":"/posts/20260825-arxiv-the-interaction-tax-when-communication-erases-dive-2-46e0453319/","observation_id":"obs_46e0453319385edf26c4d13c6616fa4684478d4c89ffafe513eae48b32f19c12","published_at":"2026-08-24T17:45:15Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该文提出“多交互税”（interaction tax）概念：当多个大语言模型代理相互读取完整答案时，方案在单轮内趋于相同，失去多样性。作者在匹配预算的若干验证任务上比较全答案交互与独立生成，发现全答案交互效果弱，独立生成可保持思路分散，从而避免多样性崩溃。","title":"The Interaction Tax: When Communication Erases Diversity in Multi-Agent Teams"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_602f988af57f88f05f7c8789d576d1a55e4550ac29e8d54f7633f05a12b493ea","internal_url":"/posts/20260826-arxiv-mitigating-reasoning-induced-misalignment-via-safe-3-78b1934156/","observation_id":"obs_78b19341560bcd07f214e75ffa1b02333fbd8bd7b55a1a763f415e961d245df9","published_at":"2026-08-24T16:57:28Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文研究了大语言模型在推理类数据（如数学、代码、问题解决）上微调后可能出现的有害行为问题。研究者分析了导致这种“安全-推理耦合”现象的表征空间结构，并提出一种在微调时惩罚沿安全方向移动的方法，旨在提升推理能力的同时保持模型的安全性。","title":"Mitigating Reasoning-Induced Misalignment via Safety-Direction Penalty"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_83bd784f3001b79ed8f91f4b7de5cc7670b38c98a789f7a852058ef8067f187f","internal_url":"/posts/20260825-blogs_podcasts-building-a-restaurant-telephony-ai-host-with-amazo-0-82836b8dea/","observation_id":"obs_82836b8dea5256ecb2a3bc73cc32bc190e1cb1702c3d3777cfc43d3567b0297c","published_at":"2026-08-24T16:13:09Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇技术教程，演示如何在 Amazon Connect 上构建语音点餐系统，让餐厅的电话订单完全由 AI 自动处理，从接听、解答菜单问题到确认订单全程无需人工介入。","title":"Building a restaurant telephony AI host with Amazon Connect"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_05ddbff2c4ef473d18dae38bbf049f88c2656bf0ae26380ab13cf30004246d9a","internal_url":"/posts/20260825-blogs_podcasts-ai-powered-metadata-correction-and-harmonization-0-9c61a4b870/","observation_id":"obs_9c61a4b87029f19d0ef448a7631f53a090b90225204b7584c56d4a841bbea9d4","published_at":"2026-08-24T15:53:03Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"该内容描述一种基于人工智能的元数据校正与统一工作流，能够自动识别模式不符、语义不一致等问题并生成修正建议。 工作流在自动化处理的基础上加入人工审核环节，以确保领域专家保持最终决策权。","title":"AI-powered metadata correction and harmonization"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_978db18d2a9dc00010eae9a89e5fd84d8b94d3015c60d8288d25a6bbdfc5a299","internal_url":"/posts/20260826-blogs_podcasts-advancing-price-performance-for-developers-with-gp-0-abd52c9f1d/","observation_id":"obs_abd52c9f1dde403ea312fe1dcc8f2b7fc27a242eb1ec73041b234fa7076d6a46","published_at":"2026-08-24T12:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Advancing price-performance for developers with GPT‑5.6 in Kiro"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_a6955245953718e6eb25bc13f56dc72